  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GAMING FOR PEACE 31.5 PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Gaming for Peace (GAP) project develops a curriculum in soft skills (gender awareness, cultural awareness, communication, empathy) for peacekeeping personnel (military, police, civilian). GAP has embedded this curriculum in a digital role-playing game with assessment in the game and before and after. There are supporting learning materials, including a Trainers manual, so it can be delivered locally by peacekeeping organizations, initially with the support of a GAP Trainer, providing universal, standardized training</narrative>
  </description>
